      "text": "multitudes of people who are sick are healed by the Lamb, 1 Ne. 11:31 (Mosiah 3:5). seek riches to administer relief to sick, Jacob 2:19. Church members do not send away any who are sick, Alma 1:30. the Son will take upon himself sicknesses of his people, Alma 7:11. Nephites have been saved from sickness by the Lord, Alma 9:22. Zeezrom lies sick at Sidom, Alma 15:3. those healed of sicknesses have been wrought upon by the Spirit, 3 Ne. 7:22. Jesus heals sick among Nephites, 3 Ne. 17:7–9 (26:15). Jesus’ disciples heal sick, 4 Ne. 1:5. ye love your money more than ye love sick, Morm. 8:37. why do ye suffer sick to pass by you without notice, Morm. 8:39. believers shall lay hands upon sick, and they shall recover, Morm. 9:24. whole need no physician, but they who are sick, Moro. 8:8.",
